WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
This is the battery storage war room, built for energy storage sites and gigafactories. What follows is a simulated incident.

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:22.000
An off-gas alarm in Container Seven is escalating toward a thermal event. The operator loads the incident report.

3
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Six engines analyze it together. Two of twelve containers are affected, and seventeen percent of site output is offline. The planning estimate is four hundred thousand to six hundred thousand dollars. The risk score is seventy-one out of one hundred.

4
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:55.000
The case moves to the Operations Strategist in one click. It carries the full analysis, and projects the exposure if the site acts now, or does not.

5
00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:10.000
In the Executive Portal, one decision is waiting: isolate Container Seven and suspend charging within two hours. The recommendation comes from the system. The authorization comes from a person.

